<title>USA: Thomas Nelson stake held by Gabelli group.</title>
<headline>Thomas Nelson stake held by Gabelli group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment manger Mario Gabelli said Wednesday it holds a 6.27 percent stake in Thomas Nelson Inc or 1,034,463 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions were effected between April 15 and June 6 at prices ranging from $9.30 and $10.75 per share.</p>
<p>Thomas Nelson, based in Nashville, Tenn., publishes Bibles and books.</p>
